<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia 2020 indexed bond yields 4.487 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia 2020 indexed bond yields 4.487 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of today's A$200 million indexed Treasury bond tender, announced by Reserve Bank of Australia (RBA):</p>
<p>  Stock	  Offering     Allotted	Avg yield   Range</p>
<p>  4.0 Aug 2020 AS200 mln    A$199.600 mln 4.487	 4.47-4.50</p>
<p>(RBA take-up nil, pct allotted at top 80)</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
</text>
